      "question": "<p>A curve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> has equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=x^2-2x-24\\sqrt{x},\\qquad x&gt;0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{\\mathrm dy}{\\mathrm dx}\"></span></li><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{\\mathrm d^2y}{\\mathrm dx^2}\"></span></li></ol><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>Verify that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> has a stationary point when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=4\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li>Determine the nature of this stationary point, giving a reason for your answer. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
